sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / Client
    participant Syntax as SyntaxEngine (spaCy)
    participant LLM as LLMClient (Multi-Provider)
    participant Fallback as UniversalLinguisticEngine
    participant Critic as SymbolicCritic
    participant ML as EditClassifier
    participant Patcher as ReverseOffsetPatcher

    User->>Syntax: Raw Sentence
    Syntax->>Syntax: Extract Dependency Triples & Morph Features
    Syntax-->>LLM: Syntactic Priors
    
    alt Online LLM Available
        LLM->>LLM: Structured JSON Decoding
    else LLM Offline / Credits Exhausted / Fallback
        LLM->>Fallback: Fast Rule & Morphology Diagnosis
        Fallback-->>LLM: Fallback Candidate Edits
    end
    
    LLM-->>Critic: Candidate DiagnosticEdits
    
    loop For each edit
        Critic->>Critic: Virtual Patch & Tree Check
        alt Invariant Violation
            Critic->>LLM: 1-Turn Reflection (Critic Feedback)
            LLM-->>Critic: Refined Edits
        end
    end
    
    Critic-->>ML: Passed & Verified Edits
    ML->>ML: Extract Features & Calibrate Probability
    ML-->>Patcher: Filtered & Reranked Edits
    Patcher->>Patcher: Sort Reverse Offsets & Apply
    Patcher-->>User: Final Corrected Text + Diagnostic Cards + Telemetry
